 Receipt n;items;prices;total
⍝ Generates a customer receipt showing purchased items, prices and total amount.
 items←⊃Orders[n]
 prices←Price[items]
 total←+/prices
 ⎕←'--------------------'
 ⎕←'Espresso House'
 ⎕←'Receipt: ',⍕ReceiptNo[n]
 ⎕←'Time: ',OrderTime[n]
 ⎕←'--------------------'
 {
     ⎕←'Item sold:',ItemName[⍵]
     ⎕←'Price: ',Price[⍵]
 }¨items
 ⎕←'--------------------'
 ⎕←'Total: ',⍕total,' SEK'
 ⎕←'Payment: ',Payment[n]
 ⎕←'Moms: 12%. Moms: ',(total×Moms),' SEK.'
 ⎕←'Netto: ',(total-(total×Moms)),' SEK.'
 ⎕←'--------------------'

 ⎕←orgnmr
